  "reasoning_content": "The user wants me to write the first chapter of a scientific review about how the gut microbiome modulates immune checkpoint inhibitor (ICI) efficacy in solid tumors.\n\nLooking at the task, I need to write Chapter 1 which covers:\n1. Cross-cancer association patterns (U1)\n2. External interference and host background (U2)\n3. Dynamic monitoring and longitudinal evolution (U3)\n4. Evidence hierarchy and translation boundaries (U4)\n\nThis is the first chapter, so I need to establish the foundation for the entire review. The reader needs to understand:\n- What observational evidence exists across different cancer types\n- How external factors (antibiotics, PPIs) interfere\n- Why longitudinal monitoring matters\n- What the current evidence limitations are\n\nLet me start writing this chapter systematically, making sure to:\n1. Build understanding progressively\n2. Distinguish correlation from causation clearly\n3. Highlight cancer-type specificity\n4. Explain methodological limitations\n5. Set up the framework for later chapters on mechanisms and interventions\n\nI'll write in Chinese as specified in the review framework.\n\nKey points to cover:\n- Melanoma has strongest evidence, NSCLC/RCC secondary\n- No universal biomarkers exist\n- Antibiotics/PPIs negatively impact efficacy\n- FMT shows promise in treatment-naïve but not refractory patients\n- Safety signals depend on ICI regimen (e.g., Prevotella-related myocarditis only in dual ICI)\n- No Phase III RCT evidence yet\n\nLet me structure this to flow logically from associations → confounders → dynamics → evidence limitations.\n\nI need to be careful about:\n- Not overstating causality from observational data\n- Distinguishing between different cancer types\n- Being precise about evidence levels (Phase I/II vs III)\n- Explaining why certain findings are context-dependent\n\nLet me begin writing the chapter.",
  "raw_stream_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\fullbody_writer_local_20261008_40cny\\live_workbench\\stages\\author_001\\efc8468c4e34e2e06dbd486163109775a5da739f96ebe8d4364e75aabd839d88\\attempt_001\\transport\\author_001-efc8468c4e34-attempt_001-key0-attempt0.sse.raw",
